"\n\n<header class=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <h1>Affiliate · Just Fluff</h1>\n      <span class=\"sub\">follow-up affiliate &amp; sampel</span>\n      <span class=\"sync\" id=\"sync\"><span class=\"dot\" id=\"syncdot\"></span><span id=\"synctxt\">Menghubungkan catatan follow-up…</span></span>\n      <label class=\"picbox\" id=\"picbox\">Petugas <select id=\"pic\" aria-label=\"Nama petugas yang sedang bekerja\"><option value=\"\">Pilih nama…</option></select></label>\n      <label class=\"picbox\">Template WA <select id=\"watpl\" aria-label=\"Template pesan WhatsApp\"></select></label>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Bagian\">\n      <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-ringkasan\" data-tab=\"ringkasan\">Ringkasan</button>\n      <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-kerja\" data-tab=\"kerja\">Kerja hari ini<span class=\"n\" id=\"n-kerja\"></span></button>\n      <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-db\" data-tab=\"db\">Database Affiliate<span class=\"n\" id=\"n-db\"></span></button>\n      <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-tiktok\" data-tab=\"tiktok\" hidden>TikTok Kreator<span class=\"n\" id=\"n-tiktok\"></span></button>\n      <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-shopee\" data-tab=\"shopee\" hidden>Shopee Affiliate<span class=\"n\" id=\"n-shopee\"></span></button>\n      <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-input\" data-tab=\"input\">Input Sampel</button>\n      <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-log\" data-tab=\"log\">Log Aktivitas</button>\n      <button role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-weekly\" data-tab=\"weekly\" hidden>Reporting</button>\n      <div class=\"navplat\" id=\"navplat\"></div>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main><div class=\"wrap\" id=\"view\"></div></main>\n<div class=\"wrap\" id=\"meet-wrap\" style=\"max-width:64rem;margin-top:-24px;padding-bottom:48px\" hidden></div>\n<div id=\"sampel-root\" hidden><div class=\"wrap sp-main\">\n  <div class=\"sp-panel\" id=\"input\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-input\">\n  <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-form\">\n    <h2 id=\"h-form\">Sampel baru</h2>\n    <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Platform\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"p-tiktok\" aria-pressed=\"true\">TikTok</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"p-shopee\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Shopee</button>\n    </div>\n    <form id=\"f\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <label>Tanggal request <span class=\"req\">*</span><input id=\"tgl_request\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n        <label>Tanggal ACC <span class=\"req\">*</span><input id=\"tgl_acc\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n        <label>Username kreator <span class=\"req\">*</span><input id=\"username\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"mis. fadillahne\" required><span id=\"u-info\" class=\"uinfo\" role=\"status\"></span></label>\n        <label>Nama produk <span class=\"req\">*</span>\n          <input id=\"produk\" name=\"produk\" required list=\"produk-list\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Ketik nama produk\"><datalist id=\"produk-list\"></datalist></label>\n        <label>SKU <span class=\"req\">*</span><input id=\"sku\" type=\"text\" list=\"sku-list\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"mis. 1PACKALPHA\" required></label>\n        <label>ID pesanan<input id=\"id_pesanan\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></label>\n        <label id=\"l-kode\" hidden>Kode permintaan<input id=\"kode\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></label>\n        <label>Ekspedisi\n          <select id=\"ekspedisi\"><option value=\"\">—</option><option>JNT</option><option>IDX</option><option>SPX</option><option>GOJEK</option></select></label>\n        <label>Ongkir (Rp) <span class=\"req\">*</span><input id=\"ongkir\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"100\" inputmode=\"numeric\" required></label>\n        <label>Kategori\n          <select id=\"kategori\"><option value=\"\">—</option><option>Tiktok Video</option><option>Tiktok dan Live</option><option>Live</option><option>Shopee Video</option></select></label>\n        <label>Status upload video\n          <select id=\"status_upload\"><option value=\"\">Belum dicek</option><option>STILL ON GOING</option><option>ON PENDING</option><option>SESUAI</option></select></label>\n      </div>\n      <datalist id=\"sku-list\">\n        <option value=\"1PACKALPHA\"><option value=\"2PACKALPHA\"><option value=\"3PACKALPHA\"><option value=\"4PACKALPHA\">\n        <option value=\"POPPINBOOZLEDSERIES\"><option value=\"POPPINBOOZLEDBRUTAL\"><option value=\"1PACKDUBAI\"><option value=\"1PACKRAINBOW\">\n        <option value=\"1PACKGAG\"><option value=\"MINICUBEMIX\"><option value=\"MINICUBEORI\">\n      </datalist>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn\" id=\"submit\" type=\"submit\">Simpan sampel</button>\n        <span class=\"msg\" id=\"msg\" role=\"status\"></span>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-list\">\n    <h2 id=\"h-list\">Sampel yang sudah diinput</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\" id=\"sync-log\" style=\"margin:-6px 0 8px\">Sinkron ke spreadsheet berjalan setiap hari sekitar pukul 16.30 WIB.</p>\n    <div class=\"list\" id=\"list\"><p class=\"empty\">Belum ada sampel. Isi form di atas, lalu tekan Simpan sampel; hasilnya muncul di sini.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"note\">Sampel berlabel \"Menunggu sinkron\" belum masuk spreadsheet. Yang belum tersinkron masih bisa dihapus kalau salah input.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"sp-panel sp-det\" id=\"rekap\" hidden>\n    <summary><h2>Rekap sampel</h2><span class=\"sp-sumnote\">Jumlah sampel, SKU, ongkir, kelengkapan data, kreator berulang</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"sp-detbody\">\n    <div class=\"filters\">\n      <label>Platform<select id=\"f-plat\"><option value=\"\">Semua</option><option>TikTok</option><option>Shopee</option></select></label>\n      <label>Bulan<select id=\"f-bulan\"><option value=\"\">Semua bulan</option></select></label>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"rk-sum\" id=\"rk-sum\">Memuat rekap…</p>\n    <div class=\"tiles\">\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Sampel terkirim</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"k-sampel\">—</div><div class=\"sub\" id=\"k-baru\">&nbsp;</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Kreator unik</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"k-kreator\">—</div><div class=\"sub\">akun berbeda</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Est. HPP sampel</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"k-hpp\">—</div><div class=\"sub\">sesuai Pricing Structure Agu 2026</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Total ongkir sampel</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"k-ongkir\">—</div><div class=\"sub\" id=\"k-ongkir-est\">&nbsp;</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Status upload tercatat</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"k-upload\">—</div><div class=\"sub\" id=\"k-sesuai\">&nbsp;</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Kreator dapat ≥2 kiriman</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"k-ulang\">—</div><div class=\"sub\">lihat tabel di bawah</div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-bulan\">\n      <h2 id=\"h-bulan\">Sampel per bulan</h2>\n      <div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Bulan</th><th class=\"n\">TikTok</th><th class=\"n\">Shopee</th><th class=\"n\">Total</th><th class=\"n\">Kreator unik</th><th class=\"n\">Porsi Alpha</th><th class=\"n\">Porsi Boozled</th><th class=\"n\">Dari form web</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"tb-bulan\"></tbody></table></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-produk\">\n      <h2 id=\"h-produk\">Sampel per SKU varian</h2>\n      <div class=\"tw\" style=\"max-height:30rem;overflow:auto\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>SKU</th><th>Produk</th><th class=\"n\">Sampel</th><th class=\"n\">Porsi</th><th class=\"n\">HPP/sampel</th><th class=\"n\">Est. HPP</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"tb-produk\"></tbody></table></div>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Est. HPP memakai HPP per varian dan paket dari sheet Pricing Structure Agustus 2026 (mis. Alpha 1 pack Rp8.300, 2 pack Rp15.000; Boozled Rp46.000). The Worst belum ada di sheet itu.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-lengkap\">\n      <h2 id=\"h-lengkap\">Kelengkapan data</h2>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin:-6px 0 10px\">Persen sampel yang kolomnya sudah terisi. Merah berarti di bawah 50%. Ongkir yang kosong di log diisi perkiraan: rata-rata ongkir asli ke kota tujuan yang sama (dari export pesanan TikTok), atau ke provinsinya kalau data kota kurang.</p>\n      <div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Platform</th><th>Bulan</th><th class=\"n\">Sampel</th><th class=\"n\">Status upload</th><th class=\"n\">Ongkir</th><th class=\"n\">Ekspedisi</th><th class=\"n\">ID pesanan</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"tb-lengkap\"></tbody></table></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-ulang\">\n      <h2 id=\"h-ulang\">Kreator yang dapat sampel lebih dari sekali</h2>\n      <input id=\"q-ulang\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Cari username\" aria-label=\"Cari username\" style=\"max-width:18rem;margin-bottom:10px\">\n      <div class=\"tw\" style=\"max-height:26rem;overflow:auto\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Platform</th><th>Username</th><th class=\"n\">Kiriman</th><th>Bulan</th><th>Produk</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"tb-ulang\"></tbody></table></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-blok\">\n      <h2 id=\"h-blok\">Kreator diblokir dari sampel <span class=\"sp-sumnote\" id=\"n-blok\"></span></h2>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin:-6px 0 10px\">Kreator yang sudah dapat sampel tapi belum pernah menghasilkan order, baik sebelum maupun setelah sampel (TikTok: export pesanan Jan–Sep dan GMV kreator Mei–21 Okt; Shopee: validasi komisi Mei–Sep dan omzet AMS Agu–21 Okt). Kreator yang sampel pertamanya setelah 21 Sep belum diblokir karena belum lewat 30 hari. Form Input Sampel akan menolak username di daftar ini kecuali dibuka blokirnya.</p>\n      <input id=\"q-blok\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Cari username\" aria-label=\"Cari kreator diblokir\" style=\"max-width:18rem;margin-bottom:10px\">\n      <div class=\"tw\" style=\"max-height:26rem;overflow:auto\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Platform</th><th>Username</th><th class=\"n\">Sampel</th><th>Pertama</th><th>Terakhir</th><th>Produk</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"tb-blok\"></tbody></table></div>\n    </section>\n    <details class=\"card sp-mini\"><summary><h2 id=\"h-target\" style=\"display:inline\">Log vs sheet TARGET</h2></summary>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin:-6px 0 10px\">Angka \"Sample Terkirim\" di sheet TARGET dibandingkan dengan jumlah sampel di log. Mei–Jul adalah capaian yang dilaporkan, Agustus adalah target. Merah berarti log kurang dari 90% angka TARGET.</p>\n      <div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Bulan</th><th>Angka TARGET</th><th class=\"n\">TikTok (TARGET)</th><th class=\"n\">TikTok (log)</th><th class=\"n\">Shopee (TARGET)</th><th class=\"n\">Shopee (log)</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"tb-target\"></tbody></table></div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"card sp-mini\"><summary><h2 id=\"h-cek\" style=\"display:inline\">Baris log yang perlu dicek</h2> <span class=\"sp-sumnote\" id=\"n-cek\"></span></summary>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin:-6px 0 10px\">Masalah yang ditemukan saat merapikan log. Kolom Sumber menunjukkan sheet dan nomor baris di file Data Affiliate.</p>\n      <input id=\"q-cek\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Cari masalah, username atau ID\" aria-label=\"Cari baris yang perlu dicek\" style=\"max-width:18rem;margin-bottom:10px\">\n      <div class=\"tw\" style=\"max-height:26rem;overflow:auto\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Masalah</th><th>Platform</th><th>Bulan</th><th>Username</th><th>SKU</th><th>ID pesanan</th><th>Sumber</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"tb-cek\"></tbody></table></div>\n    </details>\n    <p class=\"note\" data-x=\"1\">Data Mei–13 Okt berasal dari log sampel di file Data Affiliate (entri ganda sudah digabung). Sampel setelahnya berasal dari form ini.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"sp-panel sp-det\" id=\"efektif\" hidden>\n    <summary><h2>Efektivitas sampel</h2><span class=\"sp-sumnote\">Penjualan 30 hari setelah sampel dibanding biayanya</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"sp-detbody\">\n    <div class=\"filters\"><label>Platform<select id=\"ef-plat\"><option value=\"\">TikTok &amp; Shopee</option><option>TikTok</option><option>Shopee</option></select></label><label>Bulan kirim sampel<select id=\"ef-bulan\"><option value=\"\">Semua (Mei–Agu)</option></select></label></div>\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Apakah sampel menghasilkan penjualan?</h2>\n      <p class=\"rk-sum\" id=\"ef-take\">Memuat analisa…</p>\n      <p class=\"note\" id=\"ef-per\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"></p>\n    </section>\n    <div class=\"tiles\">\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Kiriman sampel dianalisa</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"e-kir\">—</div><div class=\"sub\">jendela 30 hari lengkap</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Menghasilkan order</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"e-laku\">—</div><div class=\"sub\" id=\"e-laku-n\">&nbsp;</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">GMV 30 hari setelah sampel</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"e-gmv\">—</div><div class=\"sub\">order tidak batal/retur</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Biaya sampel</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"e-biaya\">—</div><div class=\"sub\">HPP + ongkir</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">GMV per Rp1 biaya</div><div class=\"big\" id=\"e-roi\">—</div><div class=\"sub\" id=\"e-bep\">&nbsp;</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2>Per bulan kirim</h2><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Bulan</th><th class=\"n\">Kiriman</th><th class=\"n\">Laku</th><th class=\"n\">GMV</th><th class=\"n\">Biaya</th><th class=\"n\">GMV/biaya</th><th class=\"n\">Order gagal</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"et-bulan\"></tbody></table></div></section>\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2>Per produk sampel</h2><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Produk</th><th class=\"n\">Kiriman</th><th class=\"n\">Laku</th><th class=\"n\">GMV</th><th class=\"n\">Biaya</th><th class=\"n\">GMV/biaya</th><th class=\"n\">Order gagal</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"et-produk\"></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Produk dengan kurang dari 3 kiriman tidak ditampilkan.</p></section>\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2>Siapa yang paling efektif dikirimi</h2><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Kelompok</th><th class=\"n\">Kiriman</th><th class=\"n\">Laku</th><th class=\"n\">GMV</th><th class=\"n\">Biaya</th><th class=\"n\">GMV/biaya</th><th class=\"n\">Order gagal</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"et-grup\"></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"ef-prepost\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"></p></section>\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2>Sebaran GMV per kiriman</h2><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>GMV 30 hari</th><th class=\"n\">Kiriman</th><th class=\"n\">Porsi</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"et-sebaran\"></tbody></table></div></section>\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2>25 kreator dengan GMV tertinggi setelah sampel</h2><div class=\"tw\" style=\"max-height:28rem;overflow:auto\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Username</th><th class=\"n\">Kiriman</th><th>Produk</th><th class=\"n\">Order</th><th class=\"n\">GMV</th><th class=\"n\">Biaya</th><th class=\"n\">GMV/biaya</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"et-top\"></tbody></table></div></section>\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2>Dapat sampel ≥2 kali, belum menghasilkan order</h2><p class=\"note\" id=\"ef-nol\" style=\"margin:-6px 0 10px\"></p><div class=\"tw\" style=\"max-height:24rem;overflow:auto\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Username</th><th class=\"n\">Kiriman</th><th>Produk</th><th class=\"n\">Biaya</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"et-nol\"></tbody></table></div></section>\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2>Cara menghitung</h2><p class=\"note\">Satu kiriman = satu ID pesanan sampel. TikTok: penjualan dari order affiliate di export pesanan (Creator Handle = username kreator). Shopee: penjualan dari laporan validasi komisi (Username Affiliate), hanya pesanan selesai, jadi kolom \"Order gagal\" tidak tersedia untuk Shopee. Penjualan dihitung selama 30 hari sejak tanggal ACC, berhenti lebih awal kalau kreator menerima sampel berikutnya. Order batal dan retur dikeluarkan; kolom \"Order gagal\" menunjukkan porsi GMV yang batal/retur. Biaya = HPP (Pricing Structure Agu 2026) + ongkir (sebagian perkiraan dari kota tujuan). Sampel TikTok September–Oktober dan Shopee setelah 27 Agu belum dianalisa karena data penjualannya belum lengkap untuk 30 hari.</p></section>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n</div></div>\n<div id=\"drawer-root\"></div>\n\n\n\n"